# --- zdns ---
IMAPAccount zdns
Host imap.exmail.qq.com
User gaoshiming@zdns.cn
PassCmd "security find-generic-password -s mbsync-zdns-password -w"
AuthMechs LOGIN
TLSType IMAPS
TLSVersions +1.2

IMAPStore zdns-remote
Account zdns

MaildirStore zdns-local
Path ~/.local/share/mail/zdns/
Inbox ~/.local/share/mail/zdns/INBOX
Trash Trash

Channel zdns-folders
Far :zdns-remote:
Near :zdns-local:
Patterns "INBOX" "Sent*" "Drafts" "Archives" "Junk*" "sendmail"
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

Group zdns
Channel zdns-folders

